{"title": "Writhing Dance", "pageid": 28506, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Writhing_Dance", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Writhing Dance</b> is a passive feature that allows the wearer to avoid opportunity attacks when below half their hit points.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the wearer has 50% hit points or less, they don't provoke <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moondrop_Pendant\" title=\"Moondrop Pendant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Moondrop_Pendant_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moondrop_Pendant\" title=\"Moondrop Pendant\">Moondrop Pendant</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Writhing Dance does not immediately work if equipped while below 50% hit points. The wearer must take damage or be healed for the hit point threshold to be checked by Writhing Dance. This damage must take place in the same region, and cannot be from before the game was loaded.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201131\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 849/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7199/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2286/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688955/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.063      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   32.063      1 -total\n 54.78%   17.565      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 48.63%   15.592      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 44.47%   14.259      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 23.71%    7.601      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.80%    3.782      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.87%    3.486      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.53%    3.377      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.42%    3.019      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28506-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201131 and revision id 371038. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}